<%# ---------- HERO ---------- %>
<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero__text">
    <p class="eyebrow"><%= site.tagline %> · <%= site.location %></p>
    <h1>Hi, I'm Víctor. I build web applications from start to finish.</h1>
    <p class="lead">
      Full stack developer working with Next.js, SvelteKit and Ruby on Rails.
      I take care of the whole thing: frontend, backend, database and hosting.
    </p>
    <div class="hero__actions">
      <%= link_to "Chat on WhatsApp", whatsapp_url, class: "btn btn--primary", target: "_blank", rel: "noopener" %>
      <a href="#services" class="btn btn--ghost">What I can do for you</a>
    </div>
    <ul class="stack">
      <li>Next.js</li>
      <li>SvelteKit</li>
      <li>Ruby on Rails</li>
      <li>Vue</li>
      <li>Angular</li>
      <li>Node</li>
      <li>Pocketbase</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
  <%= image_placeholder("Photo: portrait of Víctor", css_class: "img-placeholder--portrait") %>
</section>

<%# ---------- ABOUT ---------- %>
<section id="about" class="section split">
  <div>
    <h2>About me</h2>
    <p>
      I love creating, drawing and maths, which is why I studied Industrial Design Engineering.
      At 20 I discovered programming and fell deeply in love with the possibilities.
      I chose a Master's in Robotics to find out whether that was what I was really looking for. It was.
    </p>
    <p>
      I spent the lockdown learning JavaScript, Angular and Node while working as a graphic designer,
      and in September 2020 I started a new life as a frontend developer. Today I work as a full stack
      developer and, in my free time, I build projects for clients.
    </p>
    <p>
      For me there is no better way to keep learning than to build new projects with alternative
      (non-mainstream) technologies. I have proven to myself that, most of the time, they are better
      than the "standard" ones.
    </p>
    <p>I wake up every day motivated, I enjoy my work and I learn something new daily. Nice to meet you! :)</p>
  </div>
  <%= image_placeholder("Image: workspace or project", css_class: "img-placeholder--tall") %>
</section>

<%# ---------- SERVICES ---------- %>
<section id="services" class="section section--alt">
  <h2>What I can do for you</h2>
  <p class="section__intro">
    I'm open to well-scoped projects that one person can deliver: from complex web applications
    with multiple integrations to simple websites.
  </p>

  <div class="cards">
    <article class="card">
      <%= image_placeholder("Icon: website") %>
      <h3>Websites</h3>
      <p>Landing pages and company sites that are fast, polished and easy to maintain.</p>
    </article>

    <article class="card">
      <%= image_placeholder("Icon: web application") %>
      <h3>Custom web applications</h3>
      <p>Dashboards, internal tools and complete products with users, payments and integrations.</p>
    </article>

    <article class="card">
      <%= image_placeholder("Icon: frontend") %>
      <h3>Frontend</h3>
      <p>Interfaces with Next.js, SvelteKit, Vue or Angular. And yes, I love CSS.</p>
    </article>

    <article class="card">
      <%= image_placeholder("Icon: backend") %>
      <h3>Backend and database</h3>
      <p>APIs and business logic with Ruby on Rails or Node, and whichever database fits best.</p>
    </article>

    <article class="card">
      <%= image_placeholder("Icon: hosting") %>
      <h3>Hosting and deployment</h3>
      <p>I put your project into production and keep it running.</p>
    </article>

    <article class="card">
      <%= image_placeholder("Icon: design") %>
      <h3>Design and UX</h3>
      <p>Background as a graphic designer: branding, layout and user experience.</p>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>

<%# ---------- EXPERIENCE ---------- %>
<section id="experience" class="section">
  <h2>Experience</h2>
  <ol class="timeline">
    <li class="timeline__item">
      <span class="timeline__date">2023 – Present</span>
      <h3>Full Stack Developer · VictorVidal.dev</h3>
      <p class="timeline__meta">Freelance · Remote</p>
      <p>Complete full stack applications for clients, from start to finish: frontend, backend, database and hosting.</p>
    </li>
    <li class="timeline__item">
      <span class="timeline__date">Present</span>
      <h3>Full Stack Developer · Snap Finance UK</h3>
      <p class="timeline__meta">React, Next.js</p>
      <p>Product development at a fintech, alongside an exceptional team I learn from every day.</p>
    </li>
    <li class="timeline__item">
      <span class="timeline__date">Sep 2020 – Dec 2022</span>
      <h3>Frontend Developer · 1MillionBot</h3>
      <p class="timeline__meta">Vue, Angular · Remote</p>
      <p>Built from scratch and maintained the web chat window in Vue, and the analytics dashboard in Angular. Project management with GitHub.</p>
    </li>
    <li class="timeline__item">
      <span class="timeline__date">Jun 2019 – Sep 2020</span>
      <h3>Graphic Design Specialist · 1MillionBot</h3>
      <p class="timeline__meta">Part-time</p>
      <p>New brand identity, website redesign (WordPress), social media, and unique avatars for chatbots.</p>
    </li>
  </ol>

  <div class="education">
    <h3>Education</h3>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Master's in Robotics and Artificial Vision</strong> — Universitat Politècnica de València (UPV)</li>
      <li><strong>Bachelor's in Industrial Design Engineering and Product Development</strong></li>
    </ul>
    <p class="timeline__meta">Languages: Spanish (native) · English (full professional proficiency)</p>
  </div>
</section>

<%# ---------- CONTACT ---------- %>
<section id="contact" class="section contact">
  <h2>Have a project in mind?</h2>
  <p class="lead">
    Tell me about it on WhatsApp or by email and I'll get back to you as soon as possible.
  </p>
  <div class="contact__actions">
    <%= link_to whatsapp_url, class: "btn btn--primary btn--large", target: "_blank", rel: "noopener" do %>
      WhatsApp · <%= whatsapp_number_display %>
    <% end %>
    <%= mail_to contact_email, contact_email, class: "btn btn--ghost btn--large" %>
  </div>
  <p class="contact__note">
    Also on <%= link_to "LinkedIn", site.linkedin_url, target: "_blank", rel: "noopener" %>.
  </p>
</section>
